# THE WARDEN SEALS THE WAY BEHIND YOU (a row that `seals`, FightSim.curtains):
# a gap passed while it hunts is sprayed shut after a tell it stands still for,
# and the curtain stands across the way, lime like its own knees. Staged as a
# player plays it: on its side of a way through the stones when it comes for
# them, out through the way; turned round, the curtain; two heavy blows, and it
# breaks.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/curtains.tour --seed=7 --realm=underground --hour=12 --held=axe_felling --config=unharmed
coast calm
wait 1.0
# The way found, and the player beyond it: the warden is put down beyond them
# (a spawn goes screen up), on the same side.
near gap
near gap_far
wait 0.6
spawn sentinel.limestone_caves
# Up to it until it has the player, all on its side of the way; then away,
# out through the way with it coming on behind.
walkto mob 12
tap swing
wait 0.8
walkto gap 12
await curtain_tell 3
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
shot 01-it-sprays-the-way-shut with shoulder,mob:sentinel.limestone_caves
await curtain_up 3
near gap_far
wait 0.8
shot 02-the-curtain-stands with shoulder
press swing 0.7
await curtain_cracked 3
wait 0.4
press swing 0.7
await curtain_down 3
wait 0.3
shot 03-broken-through with shoulder
